@startuml

!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Sequence.puml

title CGT Phase 1: Unified Open Coding with Natural Flow

Container(Unified_Coder, "Unified Coder", "Integrated Analyst", "Reads, questions, codes simultaneously")

Container(Memo_Capturer, "Memo Capturer", "Insight Recorder", "Captures theoretical ideas immediately")

Container(Comparison_Engine, "Comparison Engine", "Pattern Detector", "Compares incidents naturally")

Container(Code_Tracker, "Code Tracker", "Pattern Logger", "Tracks emergent patterns")

== Phase 1: Natural Open Coding Flow ==

note over Unified_Coder, Memo_Capturer

**CGT CORE: Unified Cognitive Process**

No artificial separation of reading/questioning/coding

One integrated agent mimics human analyst

No pre-tagging or pre-processing

end note

group Natural Batch Processing

Orchestrator -> Transcript_DB: Fetch first transcript

loop For each line/segment (natural reading flow)

Unified_Coder -> Transcript_DB: Get next segment

Unified_Coder -> Unified_Coder: Simultaneous processing

note right

**UNIFIED PROCESSING:**

1. Read line (explication)

2. Ask: "What's happening here?"

3. Ask: "What category does this indicate?"

4. Code with gerund if pattern emerges

All in one cognitive flow - no separate agents

end note

alt Pattern recognized (emergent, not forced)

Unified_Coder -> Comparison_Engine: "Potential pattern: [Gerund]"

Comparison_Engine -> Code_Tracker: Check previous incidents

Comparison_Engine -> Comparison_Engine: Natural comparison

note right

**NATURAL COMPARISON:**

• Is this similar to previous?

• How is it different?

• Does it modify understanding?

• Let comparison guide coding

end note

alt New insight during comparison

Comparison_Engine -> Memo_Capturer: "Theoretical idea!"

Memo_Capturer -> Memo_Bank: Capture immediately

note right of Memo_Bank

**IMMEDIATE MEMOING:**

• Stop everything

• Capture raw insight

• Don't format or polish

• Resume after capture

end note

end

Comparison_Engine -> Code_Tracker: Update pattern understanding

end

end

group Natural Respite (Drugless Trip)

Orchestrator -> All_Agents: "Processing pause - natural break"

note right of Orchestrator

**PRECONSCIOUS PROCESSING:**

• No active analysis during break

• System in low-power reflection mode

• Allow connections to form naturally

• Simulates human "cooking time"

end note

alt Insight emerges during respite

Memo_Capturer -> Memo_Bank: "Breakthrough during break"

end

Orchestrator -> All_Agents: "Resume processing"

end

end

